# The build context is an allow-list: everything is ignored unless it is
# re-included below. The image needs the pinned requirements and the app,
# nothing else (no .venv, no tests, no dev tooling).
*
!requirements.txt
!app/

# Never ship caches or local files, even from inside app/.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
